<h1>Main Site</h1>

<p>Current subdomain: <strong><%= @subdomain %></strong></p>

<h2>Joke of the Moment</h2>
<div style="background-color: #f0f0f0; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <p><strong>Q:</strong> <%= @joke[:setup] %></p>
  <p><strong>A:</strong> <%= @joke[:punchline] %></p>
</div>

<h2>Try these subdomains:</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>admin.lvh.me:3000</strong> - Admin dashboard (specific subdomain constraint)</li>
  <li><strong>api.lvh.me:3000</strong> - API endpoint (specific subdomain constraint)</li>
  <li><strong>acme.lvh.me:3000</strong> - Tenant "acme" (wildcard subdomain)</li>
  <li><strong>demo.lvh.me:3000</strong> - Tenant "demo" (wildcard subdomain)</li>
  <li><strong>anything.lvh.me:3000</strong> - Any tenant name works!</li>
</ul>

<p><em>Note: lvh.me is a domain that points to 127.0.0.1, which allows testing subdomains locally.</em></p>
